// Reference config for the ROG Crosshair workstation (hostname
// mcgi5sr2-System-Product-Name — ASUS ROG Crosshair VIII Hero, NVIDIA
// RTX 2080 Ti desktop), captured from `niri msg outputs` on 2026-09-17.
//
// To use on that machine: copy this file over dotconfig/niri/host.kdl.
//
// Desktop, so no touchpad and no keyboard model. Dual 2560x1440 panels
// side by side at scale 1.0 (logical size == pixel size), DP-3 left,
// DP-2 right — the x-offset below (2560) depends on that.

input {
    keyboard {
        xkb {
            layout "gb"
        }
    }

    // Mirrors Hyprland's follow_mouse = 2 (focus follows mouse).
    focus-follows-mouse max-scroll-amount="0%"
}

// Modes are pinned to the exact strings from `niri msg outputs` — a
// near-miss like "@144" doesn't match "@143.973" and niri silently falls
// back to each monitor's EDID-preferred mode, quietly losing the high
// refresh rate. Both panels here advertise a low-Hz preferred mode
// (DP-3 60Hz, DP-2 120Hz), so pinning the top mode is essential.
output "DP-3" {
    // Dell S2725DC — left. Preferred is 60Hz; panel does 143.973.
    mode "2560x1440@143.973"
    position x=0 y=0
    scale 1.0
}

output "DP-2" {
    // LG UltraGear — right. Preferred is 119.998; panel does 164.956.
    mode "2560x1440@164.956"
    position x=2560 y=0
    scale 1.0
}
